msgid ""
"The header contains the basic HTML code that you'll want to display "
"before loading the main view, together with a heading. It will also "
"output the ``$title`` variable, which we'll define later in the "
"controller. Now, create a footer at **app/Views/templates/footer.php** "
"that includes the following code::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/first-app/static_pages.rst:120
msgid ""
"If you look closely in **header.php** template we are using an "
":php:func:`esc()` function. It's a global function provided by "
